  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Ozone will cleave carbon-carbon double bonds to give ketones/carboxylic acids after oxidative workup. Here in this reaction Cleavage occurs at unsaturation of hexene and Butanoic acid and acetic acid is formed.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0066_83e6bf28fca3.png\" style=\"width: 465px; height: 84px;\" /></p>"
